    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d672">

                <pb facs="0897" n="795" xml:id="pg795"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/1602: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-10-05T09:00:00+02:35">October 5, 1935—9
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 5:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>111. Your 63, October 3, 6 p.m.<anchor n="9" xml:id="d672-f1"/> Technically no
                    state of war exists as yet. Ethiopian Government has not handed the Italian
                    Minister his passport nor has the latter asked for them.</p>
                <p>The Department may depend on my watching developments closely.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
